  "releaseNotes": "## Version 9.3.0 - January 7, 2025\n\n  - **Fixed:* Stalling problem for some files (bigger than 4MB?) when uploading to Azure Blob in .NET Framework projects.\n\n  - **Improved:** Document Viewer:\n    - **Improved:** Updated PDF.js library to 4.10.38 for stability and performance.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "File manager control for integrating file browsing, upload & download features into your ASP.NET application or site (WebForms or MVC) rapidly.",
  "title": "ASP.NET File Manager and ASP.NET File Uploader",
